> Thanks @PaarthShah. I am sending the message by entering `!window` in the matrix room. If you can tell me how to get you more info, I am happy to do so. 

@genebean If you're using Element as your client, going to the context menu of your message and copying the contents of "view source" would be helpful! Anonymizing usernames/room_ids is completely fine. 

(If it's "view decrypted source" then that would mean you're in an encrypted room, which home assistant doesn't support)
